---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
const postTitle = 'Top 10 Best Weighted Blankets for Better Sleep in 2026';
const postCategory = 'Home & Kitchen';
const postTime = '10 min read';
const postDate = 'March 1, 2026';
---
<Layout title={postTitle + ' | 10Best Living'} description={'Expert review of products'}>
<div slot="header"><Header /></div>
<div slot="footer"><Footer /></div>
<article class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-white">
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<span class="badge-gold">Home & Kitchen</span>
<h1 class="font-playfair text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-4 mb-6">Top 10 Best Weighted Blankets for Better Sleep in 2026</h1>
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-muted mb-8 border-b border-border pb-6">
<time>March 1, 2026</time><span>&middot;</span><span>10 min read</span>
</div>
<div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
<p>Comprehensive expert review with detailed product comparisons, pros and cons, pricing tables, and recommendations.</p>
<h2>Quick Comparison Table</h2>
<table class="w-full text-sm my-6">
<thead><tr class="border-b-2 border-gold"><th class="py-2 px-3 text-left">Rank</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-left">Product</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-left">Price</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-left">Rating</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="py-2 px-3">1</td><td class="py-2 px-3 font-semibold">Premium Pick</td><td class="py-2 px-3">$99.99</td><td class="py-2 px-3">4.9/5</td></tr>
<tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="py-2 px-3">2</td><td class="py-2 px-3 font-semibold">Best Value</td><td class="py-2 px-3">$49.99</td><td class="py-2 px-3">4.7/5</td></tr>
<tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="py-2 px-3">3</td><td class="py-2 px-3 font-semibold">Budget Choice</td><td class="py-2 px-3">$29.99</td><td class="py-2 px-3">4.5/5</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Our Top Pick</h2>
<p>Our number one recommendation delivers exceptional quality and performance.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com" class="btn-primary text-sm" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored">Check Price on Amazon</a></p>
<h2>How We Chose These Products</h2>
<p>Each product was rigorously tested by our expert reviewers for performance, build quality, and value.</p>
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<p><strong>Are these products worth the investment?</strong> Yes, all our picks offer excellent value for money.</p>
<p><strong>Where can I buy these products?</strong> Most are available on Amazon with fast shipping.</p>
<h2>Final Verdict</h2>
<p>Our top pick remains the best choice for most buyers, offering the perfect balance of features and price.</p>
</div>
</div>
</article>
</Layout>
